# CASTLE payments -> FIBO alignment. SOURCE of the generated src/payments/fibo_generated.rs.
# Every row's IRI was checked as an rdf:about in the pinned local corpus
# (ggen-marketplace/ontologies/public/fibo); the corpus file sha256 and the module's own
# owl:versionIRI are recorded per row. Modules carry DIFFERENT release versionIRIs, so no single
# FIBO release tag is claimed. FIBO has no concept for reversal, finality, sanctions, sealed
# admission or CONSTRUCT != DO; those stay castle: terms with no row here. Alignment grants no
# authority: it is vocabulary only.

